],["Sound","100% DirectX\u00ae 9.0C compliant sound card or equivalent onboard sound"]],"deck":2,"blurb":"Saints Row: The Third is an open-world action game set in the city of Steelport, where the Third Street Saints, now celebrities, run into a criminal group called the Syndicate. You build up your gang, take over the city and complete missions full of gunfights, car chases and absurd set pieces, along with side activities that are deliberately silly.\n\nThe campaign can be played alone or online with a friend in co-op. It leans into comedy and spectacle rather than realism, so it suits players who want a loose, playful crime sandbox with lots of customization and little concern for keeping a straight face."}}